{{! Clean minimal logo tile + modern Material 3 wordmark. Params: size (tile), textSize (wordmark). }}
<span class="relative {{default size 'size-9'}} shrink-0 grid place-items-center rounded-xl bg-grass-500/10 p-1.5 ring-1 ring-ok/25 shadow-xs transition-transform duration-200 hover:scale-105">
  <img src="/icons/logo.svg" alt="MSM Logo" class="size-full object-contain">
</span>
<span class="flex flex-col justify-center text-left leading-none">
  <span class="{{default textSize 'text-sm'}} font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Minecraft</span>
  <span class="text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-wider text-ok uppercase mt-0.5">Server Manager</span>
</span>
